The '''Temple of Agamaggan''' is located inside [[Razorfen Downs]]. Here, the Death's Head cult led by [[Death Prophet Rakameg]] works to raise their fallen god. It lies past [[Glutton]]'s patrol area in the [[Spiral of Thorns]], before the spiral rises to [[Amnennar the Coldbringer]].

